  "releaseNotes": "v2.9.0: Single package distribution with embedded modules. Fixed dependency resolution issues by embedding all framework modules (Core, Domain, Application, Infrastructure, Web) directly into the main package. No more external dependencies or NU1101 errors. Simplified installation process while maintaining full modular architecture. Updated workloads and enhanced .NET 9.0 compatibility. Perfect for enterprise applications requiring reliable package management.",
